# 本文件的 "Sensitive" 与 "Digital creative assets" 两段需与
# scripts/git/check-repository-policy.ps1 中的对应清单保持同步。
# .gitignore 负责"默认不进入索引"，策略脚本负责"强制添加后仍被拦下"。

# --- Sensitive configuration and credentials --------------------------------
.env
.env.*
# 脱敏模板允许提交（RULES.md 第 1 节）
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
!.env.dist
!.env.*.example
!.env.*.sample
!.env.*.template

*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.ppk
*.asc
*.gpg
*.kdbx
*.ovpn
id_rsa
id_dsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
.netrc
_netrc
.pgpass
.htpasswd
.npmrc
.pypirc
kubeconfig
*credential*.json
*credential*.yaml
*credential*.yml
*credential*.toml
*secret*.json
*secret*.yaml
*secret*.yml
*secret*.toml
service-account*.json

# --- IDE, OS and local state ------------------------------------------------
.idea/
# 目录被整体排除时无法再重新包含其中的文件，
# 因此必须写成 .vscode/* 而不是 .vscode/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json.example
.claude/settings.local.json
# 本机预览启动配置（端口因机器而异）
.claude/launch.json
.playwright-mcp/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.user
*.suo
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp

# --- Dependencies, caches and build outputs ---------------------------------
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.venv/
venv/
dist/
build/
out/
target/
coverage/
.cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- Digital creative assets ------------------------------------------------
# 三维模型 / 场景
*.fbx
*.obj
*.blend
*.blend1
*.gltf
*.glb
*.usd
*.usda
*.usdc
*.usdz
*.abc
*.dae
*.3ds
*.max
*.ma
*.mb
*.c4d
*.stl
*.ply
*.3mf
*.pmx
*.pmd
*.vrm
*.mdl
*.smd

# 引擎 / 打包资产
*.uasset
*.umap
*.unitypackage
*.assetbundle
*.pak
*.upk

# 骨骼 / 动画 / 本仓库自有的运行时资产格式
*.anim
*.bvh
*.skel
*.geom
*.name
*.tmd2
*.mbe
*.mat
# 通用二进制载荷（glTF buffer、资产打包体等）；
# 如某项目确需提交小体积 .bin，请走 .policy-allow 登记豁免
*.bin

# 位图 / 贴图
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.webp
*.tga
*.tif
*.tiff
*.exr
*.hdr
*.dds
*.ktx
*.ktx2
*.basis
*.psd
*.psb
*.kra
*.clip
*.xcf

# 音频
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.flac
*.aac
*.m4a
*.aiff
*.opus

# 视频
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.wmv
*.flv
*.webm

# 字体（再分发通常受许可限制，见 RULES.md 第 4 节）
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2
*.ttc

# 归档：可绕过一切扩展名检查，因此一并排除
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.gz
*.bz2
*.xz

# --- 编译产物与可执行文件 ---------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.msi
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.lib
*.a
*.pdb
*.wasm
*.node
*.class
*.jar

# --- Existing local asset-heavy experiment ----------------------------------
# 含数字创意资产，整体排除；解除前须按 RULES.md 第 6 节划分可公开源码边界
/AnimotionHub/
